    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8207b3cb045e647f43f0be02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了得知蕴含在赛马娘体内的可能性\n与极限，爱丽速子成天进行着\n追求速度的研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a62d3f6e45aec2083675a77848a41df373de80b5112379df8401db05646e4ada",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d9fd516ce167ea3349db3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在闪耀系列赛这个舞台上，\n和她一起寻求“赛马娘可能性的尽头”的日子\n就这样开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a602cf40557e7cec2f50b05613da4f9adaf3f9a55ee6261b0b73bdf36345f8ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032400.json",
      "json_path": [
