    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821fac395cc4d74d2adfada2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束之后，\n爱丽速子依然把研究摆在第一位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4762d3d43a50f4abe1edb29f548ecdf7436681ccc97d7f708bfbf07adbd7599",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e9bc89b2abdd8fcf459da42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员为了让她在经典路线上大展身手，\n规划了三年份的参赛计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b95158b594a52bee39c0affcd17ea642aecfd0c1a4931e9fcceff50ab8b241",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032401.json",
      "json_path": [
