      "uid": "zhcn:1b14acd2936e999c778b1b5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过训练员的努力，\n成功让她的注意力转移到经典赛，\n以及其前哨战的“弥生赏”上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54eeb11028fb12c78e5ed6f42552fb758da8d6357d5aafa0c547eaecc67a0f6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
